#: ../../source/index.rst:5 a7c382ae20684d0c9b14e427a96ec41b
msgid "_`Introduction`"
msgstr "简介"

#: ../../source/index.rst:7 f3b2dec6fcd94032b27caa1fac057a0d
msgid ""
"food_volume_measure is a C++17 library that measures food volume on oven "
"trays from point clouds. It follows the IM method (baseline-plane height-"
"difference integral): the empty oven becomes a height map on a fitted "
"plane, the food cloud is voxel-downsampled and clustered in that plane, "
"and the per-cell height differences are integrated into a volume in cubic"
" centimeters."
msgstr ""
"food_volume_measure 是一个 C++17 库，用来从点云测量烤盘上的食材体积。它采用 IM "
"方法（基准面高度差积分）：先把空烤盘变成拟合平面上的高度图，再把食材点云做体素降采样并在该平面内聚类，最后把逐格高度差积分成体积，单位为立方厘米。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:14 b4ceb661d58147fcb0637e10a6c8d30d
msgid "_`Algorithm Steps`"
msgstr "算法步骤"

#: ../../source/index.rst:16 896fed3161d1422cbcd606fd92112b5d
msgid ""
"The measurement runs in six stages. Each figure below is the output of "
"one stage for a real oven-tray scan."
msgstr "测量分六个阶段，下面每张图就是一次真实烤盘扫描在对应阶段的输出。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:23 846a3a400f984950ada70fb21e888634
msgid "Original input cloud"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:23 2cd4cb13c378447b8a0299bd6dde33d2
msgid ""
"**Step 1 - Raw input cloud.** The frame from the depth camera above the "
"tray. Invalid points are dropped and coordinates are converted to metres."
msgstr "**步骤 1 - 原始输入点云。** 烤盘上方深度相机拍到的帧。无效点会被丢掉，坐标统一换算成米。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:29 aaed53dc557e4310b5ab913059aff83d
msgid "Voxel-downsampled cloud"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:29 9c05fba7d38a491b934dabc9101bdfa8
msgid ""
"**Step 2 - Voxel downsampling.** Every occupied voxel is replaced by its "
"centroid. This smooths out sensor noise and makes the later stages "
"independent of the raw point density."
msgstr "**步骤 2 - 体素降采样。** 每个非空体素用内部点的质心代替。这样能压掉传感器噪声，也让后续步骤不再受原始点密度影响。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:35 c77a8436b7d54e179f2370170c696d1a
#, fuzzy
msgid "Empty-oven baseline surface"
msgstr "用 RANSAC 拟合平面的空炉基线模型"

#: ../../source/index.rst:35 1e7902508a7e4348b74c60a0a9c6b15d
msgid ""
"**Step 3 - Empty-oven baseline.** A RANSAC plane fit and per-cell median "
"heights turn the empty tray into the reference surface that food heights "
"are measured against."
msgstr "**步骤 3 - 空炉基线。** 用 RANSAC 拟合平面，再取每格的中值高度，把空烤盘变成测量食材高度所依据的参考面。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:41 7f9448ac560f49818a3ebe6bb1c94580
msgid "Cloud after background-plane removal"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:41 b7a489ced49e43839ded85abf32c6d4f
msgid ""
"**Step 4 - Background-plane removal.** The dominant tray plane is "
"removed, leaving mostly food points."
msgstr "**步骤 4 - 背景平面去除。** 去掉食材帧里占主导的烤盘平面，剩下的基本就是食材点。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:47 f2a2d2da83b14836b4572d89ebfcfc03
msgid "Segmented food components"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:47 1f349611021c42d0baec62239279af0c
msgid ""
"**Step 5 - Component segmentation.** The remaining points are projected "
"onto the baseline plane and clustered with DBSCAN, which splits different"
" food items into separate components."
msgstr "**步骤 5 - 组件分割。** 把剩余点投影到基准面上做 DBSCAN 聚类，不同食材就被分到各自的连通域。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:53 e64e307c56624b8ca48a745a5db3955f
msgid "Top surface used for the height integral"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:53 c1289d8890f34e25ae0a665a5adcf4d4
msgid ""
"**Step 6 - Height integral.** Each raster cell keeps one top-surface "
"point. Its height above the baseline is integrated over the cell area, "
"and enclosed holes are filled conservatively."
msgstr "**步骤 6 - 高度积分。** 每个栅格留一个顶面点，把它高出基准面的部分按栅格面积积分；封闭的空洞做保守补全。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:56 90fe93f614374110a6c9798697641732
msgid "_`Main Features`"
msgstr "主要特性"

#: ../../source/index.rst:58 529f22a99c27444b8bfcee283c8afec4
msgid "Empty-oven baseline model with RANSAC plane fitting"
msgstr "用 RANSAC 拟合平面的空炉基线模型"

#: ../../source/index.rst:59 96ddd98be72545ed9249648227063e4a
msgid "Voxel downsampling and DBSCAN clustering, matching Open3D"
msgstr "与 Open3D 结果一致的体素降采样和 DBSCAN 聚类"

#: ../../source/index.rst:60 e9f2a733a87d40e4bafcae3e38fbdcb5
msgid "Conservative hole completion, kept inside a single component"
msgstr "保守补洞，只在单个连通域内部进行"

#: ../../source/index.rst:61 6a206a495be740da9a9e69aecdfc7bea
msgid "Reference volumes (AABB / OBB / convex hull)"
msgstr "参考体积（AABB / OBB / 凸包）"

#: ../../source/index.rst:62 cee425888f704313bda9ebbd1cb851c9
msgid "PCD loading via ``load_pcd``"
msgstr "用 ``load_pcd`` 读取 PCD"

#: ../../source/index.rst:63 75826a4b9e5a41699297a77d9dbbee43
msgid ""
"Point-cloud processing runs on the host only; bare-metal stubs report "
"\"unsupported\""
msgstr "点云处理只在宿主机上运行，裸机上的桩函数返回“不支持”"

